---
id: rupakam-korvai-1
name: Short Rupakam korvai
counts: 9
shape: down down open
nadai: chatusram
role: korvai
source: >-
  karya, Solkattu/Score/MridangamTirmanam.hs,
  tir_icarnatic_guhan_kamalakiran_rupaka, 2023-03-10
  (github.com/elaforge/karya, GPL-3.0, used with permission). Written there as
  tri "D_o" (su "ktpkpktp ktpkpk" . "DDk"): the phrase three times, joined by
  thom with din and thom, three cycles of Short Rupakam from sam to sam.
  Converted as thi for k, ta for t, "thom+dhin" for D and thom for o; its p is
  the left-hand tha, which plays thom until the kit has one (#80). Unverified
  by a player.
accents:
  0: 1.1
